      "text": "IM integrations are built with the VibeAround Channel SDK as plugins handling platform transport (Feishu/Lark, Telegram, Slack, Discord, DingTalk, WeCom, QQ Bot, WeChat) while the SDK manages agent/session lifecycle and command bridging."
