        "slc_d8122c6747c565bf58f7db25554f3c992551d21a185aa5b2486d92b9a3fc56a5"
      ],
      "text": "The security model keeps execution local: the daemon listens on loopback unless a tunnel is enabled, dashboard APIs require a local auth token, tunnel owner surfaces require browser pairing, and Share links use six-digit access codes expiring after 10 minutes."
    },
