  "summary": "VibeAround is a local hub for AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, and others) providing agent launch with API profiles, an API bridge between provider shapes, host-side web search, IM channel plugins, web terminal/hub, tunnels, and live preview, with execution kept on the local machine. Evidence coverage: 125 of 200 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
